      "categoryID": 2,
      "benefits": "Human clinical-trial evidence: investigational subcutaneous retatrutide produced significant weight reduction in adults with obesity without diabetes. The phase 3 TRIUMPH-1 trial also found reduced knee-osteoarthritis pain and fewer apnea-hypopnea events in the corresponding affected subgroups. These results concern the studied drug, route, and patient populations and do not demonstrate benefit of retatrutide-containing stacks."
    }
  ],
